## Combine dataframes

To combine the two dataframes into a single one, use the `hstack` method like this:

::: {#13a68300 .cell execution_count=3}
``` {.python .cell-code}
(name_df
 .hstack(profession_df)
 )
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=3}
```{=html}
